      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is much more immersive to be able to show every person's avatar in large instances!\n\nIn my opinion, it will be useful to be able to specify a whitelist so that certain group staff or performers can use heavier avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
